### FairWork REST API HTTP Requests Specification
### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000
@authToken = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...

###############################################################################
### 1. SYSTEM & CONFIGURATION ENDPOINTS (PUBLIC)
###############################################################################

### Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health HTTP/1.1

### Web3 & Contract Configuration (Chain ID, Contract Address, ABI)
GET {{baseUrl}}/config HTTP/1.1


###############################################################################
### 2. AUTHENTICATION (PUBLIC / RATE LIMITED)
###############################################################################

### Request Nonce for Wallet Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/nonce HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "walletAddress": "0x3fCDb56bCFeFf21Cd18593E97C70aA95DB44E0f2"
}

### Verify Signature and Receive JWT
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/verify HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "walletAddress": "0x3fCDb56bCFeFf21Cd18593E97C70aA95DB44E0f2",
  "signature": "0x401bcff3c690f0580980fa2a9bcba33c5bdf135dbce4847e0996c5e2ec74f2603845b4b1259fbdae1a491ca0f47e305e717882202613d9426f4f10738a9a4b8e1c"
}

### Get Current Authenticated User
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}


###############################################################################
### 3. USER PROFILES (PROTECTED)
###############################################################################

### Get Current User Profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/profile HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Update User Profile (Role, Skills, GitHub Username)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/users/profile HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Dhruv",
  "role": "BOTH",
  "bio": "Web3 backend engineer & smart contract integration specialist",
  "skills": "TypeScript, Express, Prisma, ethers.js, Solidity",
  "githubUsername": "dhruv-fairwork"
}

### List All Users
GET {{baseUrl}}/users HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Get User by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/cmv2azv830004o3uwr0t9q6qq HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}


###############################################################################
### 4. COMMUNITY: POSTS, PROPOSALS, THREADS & MESSAGES (PROTECTED)
###############################################################################

### Create a Job or Service Post
POST {{baseUrl}}/community/posts HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "JOB",
  "title": "Decentralized Escrow Backend & AI Integration",
  "description": "Seeking an experienced engineer to build Express.js backend with mock blockchain & AI integration.",
  "budget": 2500,
  "tags": ["Express", "TypeScript", "Escrow", "Prisma"]
}

### Search and List Posts (with optional type, tag, query filters)
GET {{baseUrl}}/community/posts?type=JOB&tag=Express HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Get Post Details by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/community/posts/cmv2azv830004o3uwr0t9q6qq HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Submit Proposal to Post (Freelancer)
POST {{baseUrl}}/community/posts/cmv2azv830004o3uwr0t9q6qq/proposals HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "coverLetter": "I have extensive experience with Express.js and ethers.js escrow systems.",
  "proposedBudget": 2400,
  "proposedDuration": "14 days"
}

### List Proposals for Post
GET {{baseUrl}}/community/posts/cmv2azv830004o3uwr0t9q6qq/proposals HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Create or Retrieve Negotiation Thread
POST {{baseUrl}}/community/threads HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "recipientId": "cmv2azv830004o3uwr0t9q6qq",
  "subject": "Proposal Negotiation for Escrow Backend"
}

### List User's Negotiation Threads
GET {{baseUrl}}/community/threads HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Get Thread Messages
GET {{baseUrl}}/community/threads/cmv2azv8e0008o3uwzvxv0nal HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Send Message in Thread
POST {{baseUrl}}/community/threads/cmv2azv8e0008o3uwzvxv0nal/messages HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "Let us proceed with setting up the milestone agreement."
}


###############################################################################
### 5. AGREEMENTS & CANONICAL HASHING (PROTECTED)
###############################################################################

### Draft Agreement via AI from Thread and Post Context
POST {{baseUrl}}/agreements/draft HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "threadId": "cmv2azv8e0008o3uwzvxv0nal",
  "freelancerId": "cmv2azv830004o3uwr0t9q6qq",
  "title": "FairWork Autonomous Escrow Agreement"
}

### List User Agreements
GET {{baseUrl}}/agreements HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Get Agreement Details (Terms, Milestones, Events, Disputes)
GET {{baseUrl}}/agreements/cmv2azv8x000do3uwwk1fnk6z HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Edit Agreement Terms (Resets approvals to DRAFT; immutable once LOCKED)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/agreements/cmv2azv8x000do3uwwk1fnk6z HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "terms": {
    "title": "Updated Escrow Agreement",
    "summary": "Updated deliverables and milestone timelines.",
    "totalBudget": 2600,
    "currency": "USDC",
    "revisionPolicy": "Up to 3 revisions allowed.",
    "cancellationPolicy": "Escrow arbitration on formal dispute filing.",
    "milestones": [
      {
        "milestoneIndex": 0,
        "title": "Phase 1: Core Architecture",
        "description": "Express and Prisma schema.",
        "amount": 1100,
        "deadlineDays": 7,
        "deliverables": ["Models", "Auth"]
      },
      {
        "milestoneIndex": 1,
        "title": "Phase 2: Final Integration",
        "description": "Smart contract events and tests.",
        "amount": 1500,
        "deadlineDays": 14,
        "deliverables": ["Tests", "Indexer"]
      }
    ]
  }
}

### Approve Agreement (Locks terms and computes canonicalHash once both approve)
POST {{baseUrl}}/agreements/cmv2azv8x000do3uwwk1fnk6z/approve HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Link Agreement to On-Chain Contract (Verifies canonical terms hash on-chain)
POST {{baseUrl}}/agreements/cmv2azv8x000do3uwwk1fnk6z/link HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "onChainAgreementId": "1",
  "transactionHash": "0xmock_link_transaction_hash"
}


###############################################################################
### 6. MILESTONES & ORACLE RECORDING (PROTECTED)
###############################################################################

### Submit Milestone (AI Repo Analysis + Canonical Report Hash + Oracle Wallet Recording)
POST {{baseUrl}}/milestones/cmv2azv8x000eo3uwnewm913h/submit HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "repoUrl": "https://github.com/fairwork/smart-escrow-demo",
  "commitSha": "9f83a45c81d2e0b5f1234567890abcdef1234567",
  "notes": "Finished deliverable items and passing 100% test suite."
}

### Review Milestone (Approve or Reject by Client)
POST {{baseUrl}}/milestones/cmv2azv8x000eo3uwnewm913h/review HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "APPROVE",
  "feedback": "Code analysis verified and all tests passing."
}

### Get Milestone by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/milestones/cmv2azv8x000eo3uwnewm913h HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}


###############################################################################
### 7. DISPUTES & EVIDENCE UPLOAD (PROTECTED)
###############################################################################

### Raise a Dispute on an Agreement
POST {{baseUrl}}/disputes HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "agreementId": "cmv2azv8x000do3uwwk1fnk6z",
  "reason": "Milestone delivery deadline exceeded with incomplete test coverage."
}

### Get Dispute Details
GET {{baseUrl}}/disputes/cmv2b918m000fo3uw0j93b761 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Upload Evidence File (Multi-part Form Data with safe storage & SHA-256 hash)
POST {{baseUrl}}/disputes/cmv2b918m000fo3uw0j93b761/evidence HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary

------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="description"

Log file containing Git commit timestamps and CI report
------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="audit_log.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

[CI Report] 12 failed tests out of 45 test runs.
------WebKitFormBoundary--

### Request AI Dispute Summary & Oracle Recommendation
POST {{baseUrl}}/disputes/cmv2b918m000fo3uw0j93b761/ai-summary HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Resolve Dispute
POST {{baseUrl}}/disputes/cmv2b918m000fo3uw0j93b761/resolve HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "resolution": "Parties agreed to 70/30 escrow release following AI arbitration.",
  "clientRefund": 300,
  "freelancerPayout": 700
}


###############################################################################
### 8. EVENT INDEXER & AGREEMENT TIMELINE (PROTECTED)
###############################################################################

### Backfill & Index On-Chain Events for Agreement
POST {{baseUrl}}/events/index/cmv2azv8x000do3uwwk1fnk6z HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Get Chronological Timeline for Agreement
GET {{baseUrl}}/events/timeline/cmv2azv8x000do3uwwk1fnk6z HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}


###############################################################################
### 9. PAYMENTS VIEW (PROTECTED)
###############################################################################

### Get Combined Payment Summary & Event Stream
GET {{baseUrl}}/payments/agreement/cmv2azv8x000do3uwwk1fnk6z HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}


###############################################################################
### 10. DEADLINES & ALERTS (PROTECTED)
###############################################################################

### List Active Alerts (Filter by resolved=false)
GET {{baseUrl}}/alerts?resolved=false HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Resolve Alert
POST {{baseUrl}}/alerts/cmv2b998p000lo3uw8b012398/resolve HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
